.54,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 2,0:16:24.54,0:16:24.58,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 2,0:16:24.58,0:16:24.63,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 2,0:16:24.63,0:16:24.67,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 2,0:16:24.67,0:16:24.71,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 2,0:16:24.71,0:16:24.75,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 2,0:16:24.75,0:16:24.79,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 2,0:16:24.79,0:16:24.83,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 2,0:16:24.83,0:16:24.88,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 2,0:16:24.88,0:16:24.92,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 2,0:16:24.92,0:16:24.96,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 2,0:16:24.96,0:16:25.00,Sign - Map,,0,0,0,,Main GateDialogue: 5,0:16:28.96,0:16:31.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...! Hey!Dialogue: 5,0:16:31.31,0:16:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.29,0:16:38.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's... a sea train?Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.93,0:16:40.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 5,0:16:54.57,0:16:57.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! It's rushing straight towards us!Dialogue: 5,0:16:57.96,0:17:01.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they're trying to  jump onto the main island...!Dialogue: 5,0:17:01.24,0:17:05.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! They can't jump over that iron fence!Dialogue: 5,0:17:07.55,0:17:11.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Don't let them charge in!Dialogue: 5,0:17:11.00,0:17:13.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Close the gate!Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.69,0:17:28.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, granny!Dialogue: 5,0:17:28.25,0:17:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? What is it?Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.69,0:17:31.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Change of plans!Dialogue: 5,0:17:31.27,0:17:33.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys, looks like we're changing our plan.Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.73,0:17:38.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The samurai-man says that everyone should hold on tight to the car.Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.07,0:17:40.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:40.24,0:17:43.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stupid swordsman!  Did something happen?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.25,0:17:46.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They closed the main gate.Dialogue: 5,0:17:46.21,0:17:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:47.75,0:17:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! This is terrible! We're gonna crash into the gate!Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.76,0:17:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're we gonna do?!  What're we gonna do?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Dodge it, Kokoro-san ! – What're we gonna do?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.05,0:17:59.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. There's a way.Dialogue: 5,0:18:04.25,0:18:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hit the fence with a thrust, frog!Dialogue: 5,0:18:06.44,0:18:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.06,0:18:11.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 5,0:18:14.03,0:18:17.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 5,0:18:20.95,0:18:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit!Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.50,0:18:34.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...!Dialogue: 5,0:18:34.83,0:18:37.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we keep on going like this, we're gonna run ashore on the iron fence!Dialogue: 5,0:18:46.81,0:18:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 5,0:18:49.35,0:18:51.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea train is...Dialogue: 5,0:18:51.61,0:18:53.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,flying!Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.73,0:18:56.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Noo! We're gonna die!Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.74,0:18:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Are we gonna die?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.24,0:19:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.54,0:19:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-san ! Quickly, into my arms!Dialogue: 5,0:19:03.32,0:19:06.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a huge hole where we're gonna land, you idiot!Dialogue: 5,0:19:10.75,0:19:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro! You'd better have thought about the landing!Dialogue: 5,0:19:16.96,0:19:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to...Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.47,0:19:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa...Dialogue: 5,0:19:26.62,0:19:28.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ... luck. – Ribbit!Dialogue: 5,0:19:28.69,0:19:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's up to luck?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:36.28,0:19:39.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Oimo is down!Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.84,0:20:00.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Are you... the Straw Hats?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:00.93,0:20:03.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– That's right! – We are?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:03.93,0:20:07.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not important.Dialogue: 5,0:20:07.17,0:20:09.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry and move ahead!Dialogue: 5,0:20:09.14,0:20:14.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! Guys! Now move ahead as far as you can!Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.31,0:20:16.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.78,0:20:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie!Dialogue: 5,0:20:28.84,0:20:29.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 5,0:20:31.29,0:20:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you, bastards?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:33.29,0:20:36.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're the first-class guards of Enies Lobby,Dialogue: 5,0:20:36.48,0:20:40.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Watchdogs of the Law, Watchdogs for short!Dialogue: 3,0:20:40.05,0:20:43.76,Sign2,,0,0,0,,Watchdogs of the LawDialogue: 4,0:20:40.05,0:20:43.76,Sign2,,0,0,0,,Watchdogs of the LawDialogue: 2,0:20:40.05,0:20:43.76,Sign2,,0,0,0,,First-Class Guards, Enies LobbyDialogue: 3,0:20:40.05,0:20:43.76,Sign2,,0,0,0,,First-Class Guards, Enies LobbyDialogue: 5,0:20:40.58,0:20:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the orders of Chief Justice Baskerville,Dialogue: 5,0:20:43.76,0:20:47.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll cast judgment on you and bring you down at this gate!Dialogue: 5,0:20:47.93,0:20:51.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! They send one guard after another to block us!Dialogue: 5,0:20:51.68,0:20:54.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oimo! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.41,0:20:57.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you let pirates like them open the gate?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.99,0:20:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!Dialogue: 5,0:21:01.78,0:21:03.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I passed out!Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.57,0:21:08.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! He woke up!Dialogue: 5,0:21:11.45,0:21:16.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you! You're not gonna get away with this!Dialogue: 5,0:21:23.85,0:21:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:41.53,0:21:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why the hell...  did Rocketman come from the sky?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.82,0:21:48.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was no point in us opening the gate!Dialogue: 5,0:21:56.71,0:21:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What just happened?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:00.21,0:22:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are they okay after charging in here like that?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.31,0:22:11.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-They aren't coming out...Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.66,0:22:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.12,0:22:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are those two?!Dialogue: 5,0:22:42.80,0:22:46.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Should we have introduced ourselves first?Dialogue: 5,0:22:46.84,0:22:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's stupid. Why should we have?Dialogue: 5,0:22:49.84,0:22:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roronoa and the others are here!Dialogue: 5,0:22:51.76,0:22:53.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting!Dialogue: 5,0:22:59.47,0:23:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just as I planned...Dialogue: 5,0:23:01.77,0:23:03.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.69,0:23:09.69,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee, PhosCity  Quality Control: Feeso, Pepperjack  Soundtracking: Halee  Graphics: Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 5,0:07:01.47,0:07:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.Dialogue: 7,0:11:14.30,0:11:17.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber... Gatling!Dialogue: 7,0:11:18.19,0:11:21.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber... Whip!Dialogue: 7,0:11:23.91,0:11:26.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giant Scythe!Dialogue: 7,0:11:28.41,0:11:30.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bell!Dialogue: 7,0:11:31.52,0:11:33.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mallet!Dialogue: 7,0:11:34.92,0:11:37.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bazooka!Dialogue: 7,0:11:42.77,0:11:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber... Stamp!Dialogue: 7,0:12:24.44,0:12:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber... Volcano!Dialogue: 7,0:13:03.39,0:13:06.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 7,0:13:07.10,0:13:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gatling!Dialogue: 6,0:15:13.79,0:15:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rope Action...Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.53,0:15:18.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Top Knot!Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:03.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:06.46,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:18.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cross this endless sea with me and search for Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,a global miracle no oneDialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,has yet been able to findDialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,With our hearts pounding,Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll just charge ahead as we please, following Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:35.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the footprints of those who pursue their dreams Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No matter how stormy the night,Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,if we put our minds together, Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:46.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll get through it Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,alwaysDialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Even though there are tearsDialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:01:00.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we don't want anyone to seeDialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:06.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the compass that leads to our dreams Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:09.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,always points straight ahead Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We can't stop hereDialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get running,Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,head past everyone elseDialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,So long as we don't run from it,Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we can take hold of tomorrow Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,everything we see in the moment,Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we should record it all Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,in the blank slates of our minds Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:41.62,Kanji,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 2,0:00:00.38,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 2,0:00:00.42,0:00:01.73,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogue: 3,0:00:01.73,0:00:02.13,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,daDialogu